\begin_layout Standard
This paper introduces programming chess with emphasis on semantics and code clarity rather than algorithmic efficiency.
 The code shall read like natural text and be self–documenting,
 while still doing the job,
 effectively.
 Given that we supply a graphical layer to the game for practical smoke testing,
 this package is called 
\begin_inset listings
lstparams "language=Python,fontfamily=tt,fontsize={\scriptsize},breaklines=true,tabsize=4"
inline true
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
goochess
\end_layout

\end_inset

 after GOOChess,
 standing for 
\emph on
Graphical Object–Oriented Chess
\emph default
.
\end_layout

